  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Sea Surface Temperature Data by JAFIC in NEAR-GOOS Regional Delayed Mode Data Base (RDMDB)",
  "description": "Sea surface and sub surface temperature data from Japan Fisheries Information Service Center (JAFIC) are available in the NEAR-GOOS Regional Delayed Mode Data Base. Data sets may be obtained directly from the North-East Asian Regional - Global Ocean Observing System (NEAR-GOOS) Regional Delayed Mode Data Base (RDMDB) at http://near-goos1.jodc.go.jp/ with a user account. First time users must register to gain database access.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To offer basic data service to NEAR-GOOS and GOOS communities as part of the NEAR-GOOS project.",
